meta {
  name: Download ASH students
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/ash/download/ashstudent
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Download ASH Students (CSV Export)
  
  Exports the entire `ash_student` table as a CSV file download. Selects all rows from the table (no filters, no pagination) and converts the records to CSV using json2csv, and returns the CSV as raw file bytes with Content-Type: text/csv and Content-Disposition: attachment. The response is not JSON; frontend clients should read it as a Blob and trigger a browser download.
  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication (`authenticate()`) and `"read"` permission (`authorize("read")`).
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response — `200 OK`
  
  **Content-Type:** `text/csv; charset=utf-8`
  **Content-Disposition:** `attachment; filename="ash_students.csv"`
  
  The CSV contains one row per ASH student record with the following columns (in order):
  
  | Column | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID primary key |
  | `programType` | Programme the student applied for |
  | `firstName` | Student's first name |
  | `middleName` | Student's middle name |
  | `surname` | Student's surname |
  | `gender` | Student's gender |
  | `age` | Student's age at registration |
  | `dob` | Date of birth |
  | `primaryLanguage` | Student's primary language |
  | `homeAddress` | Home address |
  | `studentPhone` | Student phone number |
  | `passportPhotoUrl` | Cloudinary URL for passport photo |
  | `passportPhotoPublicId` | Cloudinary public ID for passport photo |
  | `schoolName` | Name of school attended |
  | `schoolTown` | Town where the school is located |
  | `schoolLga` | LGA where the school is located |
  | `schoolState` | State where the school is located |
  | `currentClass` | Student's current class level |
  | `classPositionLastTerm` | Position in class last term |
  | `lastResultUrl` | Cloudinary URL for last result document |
  | `lastResultPublicId` | Cloudinary public ID for last result |
  | `prevAfterschoolProgram` | Whether student attended a previous afterschool programme |
  | `reasonForJoining` | Reason for joining ASH |
  | `fathersName` | Father's full name |
  | `fathersPhone` | Father's phone number |
  | `fathersOccupation` | Father's occupation |
  | `mothersName` | Mother's full name |
  | `mothersPhone` | Mother's phone number |
  | `mothersOccupation` | Mother's occupation |
  | `guardianName` | Guardian's full name |
  | `guardianRelationship` | Guardian's relationship to student |
  | `guardianPhone` | Guardian's phone number |
  | `guardianOccupation` | Guardian's occupation |
  | `householdIncomeRange` | Household income range |
  | `hasLearningCondition` | Whether the student has a learning condition |
  | `learningConditions` | Description of learning conditions (if any) |
  | `parentConsent` | Whether parent consent was given |
  | `declarationConfirmed` | Whether the declaration was confirmed |
  | `parentSignatureUrl` | Cloudinary URL for parent signature |
  | `parentSignaturePublicId` | Cloudinary public ID for parent signature |
  | `assignedMentor` | Name of the assigned mentor |
  | `pretestScore` | Pre-test score at registration |
  | `status` | Application status (`pending`, `accepted`, `rejected`) |
  | `updatedAt` | Last update timestamp |
  | `createdAt` | Creation timestamp |
  | `deletedAt` | Soft-delete timestamp (null if active) |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token. |
  | `403 Forbidden` | User lacks the `"read"` permission. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
